OL,3,GNEWSAMan in life-threatening condition
OL,4,Aafter shop robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in a life-threatening
OL,7,Fcondition after a robbery in broad
OL,8,Fdaylight at a jewellery store.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said six men
OL,11,Fentered Lala Jewellers on Gladstone
OL,12,FStreet in Peterborough at about 11:50
OL,13,FGMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FA senior councillor later said it was
OL,16,Fbelieved that the victim had been
OL,17,Fstabbed.
OL,19,FShelves were emptied and two employees
OL,20,Fbehind the counter were assaulted,
OL,21,Fbefore the thieves fled in separate
OL,22,Fvehicles.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
